    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What is findbyface?</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>findbyface</strong> is an AI-powered visual search engine for OnlyFans. Upload a
        clear photo of a face and our system instantly surfaces creators who share similar facial
        features — same eyes, smile, and overall look. It's built for discovery: whether you spotted
        someone on social media, have a celebrity crush, or simply want to find creators that match
        your type, we help you find them in seconds.
      </p>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>
        Our matching runs entirely on visual similarity. When you upload a photo, a face-recognition
        model detects the face and converts it into a numeric descriptor — a mathematical fingerprint
        of facial geometry. We then compare that descriptor against creator profiles to rank the
        closest visual matches. No names, reverse lookups, or personal data are required.
      </p>

      <h2>Privacy first</h2>
      <p>
        Your uploaded photo is processed to generate matches and is not stored or shared. There's no
        account required to run a search, and we don't sell your data. Read more in our
        <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Important note on results</h2>
      <p>
        findbyface returns creators who <strong>visually resemble</strong> an uploaded face. Matches
        are based on appearance and are intended for discovery and entertainment only — they are
        <strong>not</strong> a confirmation of identity. A high match percentage does not mean two
        people are the same person.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
